<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We utilize a single A100 GPU(40GB) for training and inference.
The environment we used includes python=3.10, torch=2.6.0, transformers=4.53.0, and CUDA 12.4.
Below are some of the hyperparameter settings used during the training process:</p>
