<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Prompt adjustion of Single-QA tasks</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Section <a href="#S3" title="3 Observations ‣ Judge Q: Trainable Queries for Optimized Information Retentionin KV Cache Eviction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>, we modify the prompt template for Single-QA tasks to evaluate the performance of the current pruning method when the question is placed at the beginning.
Below are the specific prompt templates before and after the adjustment, the key parts are bolded:</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.SS3.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="1910.59" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 700 1910.59" width="700"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,1910.59) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#0000B3;" fill="#0000B3" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.32 L 0 1905.27 C 0 1908.21 2.38 1910.59 5.32 1910.59 L 694.68 1910.59 C 697.62 1910.59 700 1908.21 700 1905.27 L 700 5.32 C 700 2.38 697.62 0 694.68 0 L 5.32 0 C 2.38 0 0 2.38 0 5.32 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F7F7FF;" fill="#F7F7FF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.38 5.32 L 1.38 1887.22 L 698.62 1887.22 L 698.62 5.32 C 698.62 3.15 696.85 1.38 694.68 1.38 L 5.32 1.38 C 3.15 1.38 1.38 3.15 1.38 5.32 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 13.84 1895.45)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:42.25em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="584.62"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
